<section class="section reader-panel"><h2>Read the story. Follow the reference.</h2><p>The stories are condensed retellings, with their sources gathered on one page. Tradition notes distinguish accounts, and captions identify photographs and artistic interpretations. Questions for reflection belong to the journal’s editorial voice.</p><a href="/about.html">Our editorial approach →</a></section></main>
